{"type":"message","id":"b40a9e20","parentId":"0cd26fe6","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:26:18.884Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We've hit the rate limit. Let me report the findings to VAN. The ainvest API seems to:\n1. Not recognize HK stock tickers in any common format\n2. Have strict rate limits\n3. Possibly only support US stocks\n\nI should inform VAN about this and suggest alternatives.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 VAN，测试了 ainvest API 对港股 09992.HK (泡泡玛特) 的查询，结果如下：\n\n---\n\n**❌ 问题发现：**\n\n| 测试的 ticker 格式 | 结果 |\n|-------------------|------|\n| `09992.HK` | Unknown ticker |\n| `9992.HK` | Unknown ticker |\n| `09992` | Unknown ticker |\n| `09992:HKG` | Unknown ticker |\n| `09992:xHKG` | Unknown ticker |\n| `PMRTY` (ADR) | Unknown ticker |\n\n**API 验证：** 用 `AAPL` 测试返回了 `4014` (频率限制)，说明 API 本身可用，但 **该 API 可能不支持港股**，或使用了非标准的 ticker 格式。\n\n---\n\n**🔍 可能原因：**\n1. **ainvest API 仅支持美股** — 这是最大可能\n2. 港股 ticker 格式特殊 — 需查阅 ainvest 官方文档确认\n3. API 权限不足 — 需升级才能访问港股数据\n\n---\n\n**💡 建议替代方案：**\n\n| 方案 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **Yahoo Finance** | 免费，支持港股，ticker: `09992.HK` |\n| **itick.org** | 免费港股实时行情 API |\n| **富途/老虎** | 有开放 API，支持港股 |\n\n需要我用其他 API 获取泡泡玛特的 K 线数据吗？还是 VAN 有 ainvest 的港股文档可以参考？ 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":496,"output":494,"cacheRead":66944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67934,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779042370492}}
