{"type":"message","id":"a953bbb2","parentId":"3120bb23","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:35:28.649Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_6ec746552ea544c3a69abd0b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"date\": \"2026-04-10\",\n  \"scan_time\": \"18:10\",\n  \"market_overview\": {\n    \"sentiment\": \"极度恐惧（加密货币FGI=11）但美股风险偏好回升\",\n    \"major_indices\": {\n      \"us_dow\": \"+0.58%\",\n      \"us_spx\": \"+0.62%\",\n      \"us_nasdaq\": \"+0.83%\",\n      \"a50_futures\": \"+0.40%\",\n      \"china_sse\": \"+0.63%\",\n      \"china_szse\": \"+1.74%\",\n      \"china_cy\": \"+2.62%\"\n    },\n    \"crypto\": {\n      \"btc_price\": \"$73,000+\",\n      \"btc_change\": \"+2.7%\",\n      \"fear_greed_index\": \"11 (极度恐惧)\"\n    },\n    \"commodities\": {\n      \"wti_crude\": \"$97.98/bbl (+3.78%)\",\n      \"brent_crude\": \"$96.41/bbl (+1.75%)\",\n      \"gold\": \"$4,790.50/oz (+0.28%)\",\n      \"silver\": \"$75.47/oz (+0.12%)\"\n    },\n    \"us_stocks_streak\": {\n      \"spx_days\": \"7\",\n      \"nasdaq_days\": \"7\",\n      \"note\": \"连续七日上涨\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"geopolitical_risks\": [\n    {\n      \"event\": \"以黎谈判启动\",\n      \"status\": \"以色列同意与黎巴嫩直接谈判\",\n      \"impact\": \"地缘风险缓解但仍存不确定性\",\n      \"timeline\": \"下周在华盛顿举行\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"event\": \"霍尔木兹海峡通行\",\n      \"status\": \"仍受限，仅少量干散货船通行\",\n      \"impact\": \"能源供应担忧持续\",\n      \"trump_stance\": \"警告伊朗不收取过路费\",\n      \"iran_response\": \"议长指责美国违反停火协议\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"key_events_today\": [\n    {\n      \"time\": \"09:30\",\n      \"event\": \"中国3月CPI/PPI数据发布\",\n\n[151 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779042928648}}
{"type":"message","id":"9a5e5179","parentId":"a953bbb2","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:35:38.593Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clearer picture. Let me summarize what I found about the data sources used previously:\n\n1. **No specific API endpoints were hardcoded** - The data was gathered through web searches and manual data collection\n2. **Data sources mentioned in signals files:**\n   - 新华网 (Xinhua)\n   - 财联社 (CLS)\n   - 21世纪经济报道 (21st Century Business Herald)\n   - 上观新闻\n3. **Market data was collected through:**\n   - `coze_web_search` tool for real-time market data\n   - Manual web scraping/fetching from financial news sites\n   - The signals files contain structured data that was manually compiled\n\n4. **The ainvest API** that VAN provided is a new addition - it wasn't used before. The previous data collection was primarily through web searches.\n\nSo VAN's question about which APIs I previously used - the answer is that I didn't use specific financial data APIs. I used `coze_web_search` for real-time market data and collected information from financial news websites. The ainvest API is a new tool VAN is trying to integrate.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 VAN，回顾了一下之前的记录：\n\n---\n\n**📊 之前的数据来源方式：**\n\n之前**没有使用固定的金融数据 API**，主要靠以下方式获取市场数据：\n\n| 方式 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| **`coze_web_search`** | 搜索实时行情、新闻、恐惧贪婪指数等 |\n| **新闻网站抓取** | 新华网、财联社、21世纪经济报道、东方财富等 |\n| **手动整理** | 将搜索结果结构化写入 signals/*.json |\n\n---\n\n**📁 signals 文件中的数据来源标注示例：**\n- `\"source\": \"新华网 2026-04-12 15:19\"`\n- `\"source\": \"21世纪经济报道 2026-04-13\"`\n- `\"source\": \"新华社、财联社\"`\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 问题所在：**\n\n这种方式**不够稳定** — 依赖网页搜索结果的实时性和准确性，没有直接对接行情 API。\n\n**💡 建议：**\n\n如果 VAN 想接入 ainvest API（或其他行情 API），我可以帮你：\n1. 测试 API 支持的市场和 ticker 格式\n2. 写一个数据拉取脚本\n3. 集成到心跳扫描流程中\n\n但 ainvest API 目前看来**不支持港股**（测试了 09992.HK 的多种格式都返回 Unknown ticker）。\n\n需要我帮你找一个支持港股的行情 API 吗？还是你有 ainvest 的官方文档可以确认 ticker 格式？ 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":663,"output":817,"cacheRead":72512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73992,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779042928650}}
