{"type":"message","id":"0cb17e4e","parentId":"6d153bbb","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:37:12.251Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_289bd5e027bb44f8b7e739e4","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:### API Keys\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:| Key | 用途 | 状态 |\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:| V3: `4QKfGjVN-WEinGRk_Pz5-HZ8` | 主力 Key | ✅ 生效中 |\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:| V4: `hArvuFv1tqxS7fnos2uwuDfB` | 备用 Key | ✅ 已测试 |\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:### Key 切换 (手动)\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:当主力 Key V3 失效时，告诉我\"切换到 V4 Key\"，我会帮你更新。\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:## Key 轮换策略\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:OpenClaw 单 provider 只支持一个 apiKey，但我们可以：\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:- `gitcode-v3` → V3 Key\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:- `gitcode-v4` → V4 Key\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:## API 信息\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:- Base URL: `https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5`\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:- 上下文窗口: 32000 tokens\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:- 最大输出: 7168 tokens\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:- 参数格式: 驼峰式 (maxTokens, topP 等)\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/backtest-expert/SKILL.md:## Key Testing Principles\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/coze-web-fetch/SKILL.md:Raw API response with full content structure.\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/coze-web-search/SKILL.md:Raw API response.\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/crypto-backtest/SKILL.md:  --capital 1000 --leverage 5\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/crypto-backtest/SKILL.md:  --capital 1000 --leverage 5 \\\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/crypto-news/SKILL.md:      env: [\"BLOCKBEATS_API_KEY\"]\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/earnings-reader/SKILL.md:keywords:\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analysis/SKILL.md:这是一个用于投资组合分析的技能，支持从免费API获取各类资产行情数据，并提供文字报告和图表可视化。优化版本整合了滚动窗口调仓逻辑和回测功能。\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analysis/SKILL.md:- Alpha Vantage (免费API)\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analysis/SKILL.md:需要配置API密钥（如使用Alpha Vantage）：\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analysis/SKILL.md:- ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=your_key_here\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analyst/SKILL.md:description: Financial analysis and research workflows for market research, equity research, comparable companies, precedent transactions, and DCF valuation. Use when asked to build or critique DCF models, comps/precedents tables, competitor or strategy analysis, market sizing, or to deliver analyst-ready outputs in Excel, PowerPoint, or Markdown from CSV/Excel/SQL/API/web data.\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analyst/SKILL.md:- Gather data sources (CSV/Excel/SQL/API/web) and ask for access details or files.\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analyst/SKILL.md:- Build a comps table with key operating metrics and trading multiples.\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/financial-analyst/SKILL.md:### Competitive Strategy and Key Competitors"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":10,"aggregated":"/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:### API Keys\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:| Key | 用途 | 状态 |\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:| V3: `4QKfGjVN-WEinGRk_Pz5-HZ8` | 主力 Key | ✅ 生效中 |\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:| V4: `hArvuFv1tqxS7fnos2uwuDfB` | 备用 Key | ✅ 已测试 |\n/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/aigit-switch/SKILL.md:### Key 切换 (手动)\n/workspace/projects/works