{"type":"message","id":"41dce25d","parentId":"fffda912","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:46:38.519Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Some paths returned empty (no response body) which might indicate different behavior:\n- `/open/marketdata/candles` - empty (the one VAN originally gave me)\n- `/open/quotes` - empty\n- `/open/ticker` - empty\n- `/open/tickers` - empty\n- `/open/ping` - empty\n\nLet me test those more carefully. Also the `/open/marketdata/candles` returned empty which could mean it's accepting the request but we need parameters. Let me try the candles endpoint with proper query params.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5d6a1ec8137e44428194c161","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# The /open/marketdata/candles returned empty (not 404), so it IS a valid endpoint\n# Let me try with various param combinations\necho \"=== With symbol param ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?symbol=AAPL&interval=day&step=1\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== With AAPL.US ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?symbol=AAPL.US&interval=day&step=1\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== With period param ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?symbol=AAPL&interval=day&step=1&period=1M\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":603,"output":544,"cacheRead":54528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55675,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779043591320}}
