{"type":"message","id":"c346c18a","parentId":"68254cac","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:47:48.523Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the rate limiting is hitting us. But we have confirmed some important things:\n\n1. The `/open/marketdata/candles` endpoint IS valid and works\n2. It requires `ticker`, `from`, `interval`, `step` params\n3. `from` must be a Unix timestamp in milliseconds\n4. AAPL works (US stocks)\n5. 09992.HK doesn't work (Hong Kong stocks)\n6. We hit rate limits (4014) quickly\n\nLet me wait and test a few more things - crypto, ETFs, and more HK stock formats.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_70319094821546a185742008","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Wait for rate limit reset, then test more thoroughly\nsleep 15\n\necho \"=== Test more endpoints ===\"\n# Check other possible endpoint paths\nfor path in \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/intraday\" \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/realtime\" \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/price\" \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/price?ticker=AAPL\" \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/stock/candles?ticker=AAPL&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/crypto/candles?ticker=BTC-USD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/forex/candles?ticker=EURUSD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" \\\n  \"/open/marketdata/index/candles?ticker=^GSPC&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\"; do\n  echo \"--- $path ---\"\n  timeout 5 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \"https://openapi.ainvest.com$path\" 2>&1 | head -1\n  echo \"\"\ndone","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":181,"output":605,"cacheRead":57664,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58450,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779043660843}}
