{"type":"message","id":"b99d0783","parentId":"f20e50ca","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:48:35.509Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the `/open/marketdata/candles` endpoint is the main one, with `ticker` and `from` (timestamp ms) required params. It doesn't support separate stock/crypto/forex subpaths.\n\nLet me now test what ticker formats work for different asset types:\n- US stocks: AAPL ✅\n- HK stocks: 09992.HK ❌\n- Crypto: BTC-USD, BTCUSD - need to test after rate limit\n- Forex: EURUSD - need to test\n- ETF: SPY - rate limited\n- Index: ^GSPC - caused 400 error (caret issue)\n\nLet me also check if there are other available endpoints. The `/open/marketdata/price` and `/open/marketdata/forex/candles` returned empty (no output), which might mean they timed out or returned something else.\n\nLet me wait and test more systematically.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dce31cb5ced748b5a651fe36","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Wait for rate limit, then systematically test tickers and intervals\nsleep 20\n\necho \"=== BTCUSD (no dash) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=BTCUSD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== EURUSD (forex) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=EURUSD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== GLD (gold ETF) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=GLD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== TSLA ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/c