{"type":"message","id":"4d6cbf40","parentId":"5bcebd2a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:49:13.332Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good progress! Let me summarize findings:\n\n1. **AAPL** ✅ - US stocks work\n2. **TSLA** ✅ - US stocks work\n3. **09992.HK** ❌ - Hong Kong stocks don't work\n4. **EURUSD** ❌ - Forex doesn't work\n5. **BTCUSD** ❌ - Crypto returns error (but not \"Unknown ticker\", so it might be partially supported)\n6. **GLD** - empty (timed out?)\n\nThe API works for US stocks. Let me test a few more things: different intervals, different step values, and maybe the \"to\" parameter.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_32082e1eb7124a8f920c44ce","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Test more: different intervals and date ranges for AAPL\nsleep 10\n\necho \"=== AAPL - multi days (from=2026-05-01) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=AAPL&interval=day&step=1&from=1746057600000\" 2>&1 | python3 -m json.tool 2>/dev/null | head -60\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== AAPL - 1h interval ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=AAPL&interval=hour&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1 | python3 -m json.tool 2>/dev/null | head -30","timeout":40}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":323,"output":576,"cacheRead":59776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60675,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779043746628}}
