{"type":"message","id":"7abcf67c","parentId":"09db6ecc","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:49:35.010Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the API:\n- Supports intervals: min, day, week, month, year\n- Has a data time limit on the free tier (can't go too far back)\n- Supports US stocks (AAPL, TSLA, SPY)\n- Does NOT support HK stocks (09992.HK, 9992.HK)\n- Does NOT support forex (EURUSD)\n- BTCUSD returned a server error (not unknown ticker)\n- Has rate limits (4014)\n- Requires `ticker`, `from` (timestamp ms), `interval`, `step` params\n- `from` must be epoch milliseconds\n\nLet me test what the data time limit is and test more tickers.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3ed52c858cae4b02ac96e7c9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Test step parameter and data limit\nsleep 10\n\necho \"=== AAPL - step=5 (5min candles) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=AAPL&interval=min&step=5&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1 | python3 -m json.tool 2>/dev/null | head -30\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== AAPL week ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -OH \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://open candles?ticker=AAPL&interval=week&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1 | head -20\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== NVDA ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=NVDA&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1 | python3 -m json.tool 2>/dev/null | head -20","timeout":40}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":223,"output":671,"cacheRead":60544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61438,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779043767119}}
