{"type":"message","id":"c078ddc7","parentId":"41208c83","timestamp":"2026-05-17T18:49:58.201Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me wait longer and test more things. But first let me compile what I've found so far.\n\nSo far the findings:\n1. **Endpoint**: `https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles`\n2. **Required params**: `ticker`, `from` (epoch ms), `interval`, `step`\n3. **Intervals**: `min`, `day`, `week`, `month`, `year`\n4. **Auth**: Bearer token\n5. **US stocks work**: AAPL ✅, TSLA ✅\n6. **HK stocks don't work**: 09992.HK ❌\n7. **Crypto error**: BTCUSD returned error 500\n8. **Forex unknown**: EURUSD ❌ (Unknown ticker)\n9. **Free tier limits**: \n   - Data time limit (can't go back too far)\n   - Rate limit (4014 - request frequency limited)\n   - Min step=5 candles seem to return empty data\n10. **Data fields**: t (timestamp), o (open), h (high), l (low), c (close), a (amount), v (volume)\n\nLet me do a final comprehensive test and then write a report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_628d57340221418fb1d95af1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Final tests with longer sleep\nsleep 25\n\necho \"=== BTCUSD (crypto) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=BTCUSD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== ETHUSD ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=ETHUSD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== XAUUSD (gold) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer aKKMObbA86TCSO2raIpFOU2TaYTG6HVa\" \\\n  \"https://openapi.ainvest.com/open/marketdata/candles?ticker=XAUUSD&interval=day&step=1&from=1778928000000\" 2>&1\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== GC=F (gold futures) ===\"\ntimeout 8 curl -s -H