{"type":"message","id":"6ee8adca","parentId":"748459f1","timestamp":"2026-05-17T19:07:03.696Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The VPS has significant network issues - SSL/TLS connections to most financial data sources are being blocked or reset. This is likely a Chinese VPS with restricted international network access. Let me check what actually works:\n\n1. `akshare` US stock data via `stock_us_daily` ✅ (uses different data path)\n2. `akshare` A-stock ❌ (connection error to eastmoney)\n3. `ccxt` Binance ❌ (connection reset)\n4. `yfinance` ❌ (SSL/TLS error)\n5. Ainvest API ✅ (works! - it uses HTTPS which is working)\n\nSo the situation is:\n- This VPS has limited international connectivity\n- Ainvest actually WORKS (HTTPS connections are fine)\n- AKShare's US stock function works (uses a different data source internally)\n- Most Chinese data sources (eastmoney) fail\n- Most crypto exchanges (Binance) fail due to connection reset\n\nWait - but earlier the Ainvest API DID work for AAPL and TSLA! So the Ainvest API is actually functional on this server. The problem is only with HK stocks, crypto, forex etc.\n\nLet me reconsider the situation. The Ainvest API works fine for US stocks. For other markets, I need to figure out what works on this specific server.\n\nLet me also check if there's a proxy or if certain domains work better.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_28d67047ce7d494ebae0f2db","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check network connectivity to key financial APIs\necho \"=== Network connectivity test ===\"\nfor host in api.binance.com query1.finance.yahoo.com push2his.eastmoney.com openapi.ainvest.com api.coze.com; do\n  echo -n \"$host: \"\n  timeout 5 curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"HTTP %{http_code} | SSL: %{ssl_verify_result}\" \"https://$host\" 2>&1\n  echo \"\"\ndone\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== AKShare US stock (uses different internal source) ===\"\npython3 -c \"\nimport akshare as ak\ndf = ak.stock_us_daily(symbol='AAPL', adjust='')\nprint(f'AAPL: {len(df)} rows, last close: {df.iloc[-1][\\\"close\\\"]}')\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":2449,"output":778,"cacheRead":82304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85531,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779044811840}}
