{"type":"message","id":"a7bc840a","parentId":"ed62c16a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T19:07:29.129Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"yfinance has cache issues. Let me try a different approach - use the requests-based yfinance or try an older version, or just work with what we have.\n\nLet me focus on what actually WORKS on this server:\n1. AKShare US stocks ✅ (stock_us_daily)\n2. Ainvest API ✅ (US stocks, daily candles)\n3. coze_web_search ✅ (for getting any data we need)\n\nFor HK stocks, crypto, forex - neither direct API connections work reliably. We can use coze_web_search as a fallback.\n\nLet me report to VAN what's installed and working.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5a4bf28811ff4eab87252963","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Test AKShare A-stock with different approach (using eastmoney web API directly)\npython3 -c \"\nimport akshare as ak\n\n# Test A-share historical data\ntry:\n    df = ak.stock_us_daily(symbol='AAPL', adjust='')\n    print('✅ AKShare美股 AAPL:', len(df), '行, 最新收盘:', df.iloc[-1]['close'])\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print('❌ 美股:', e)\n\n# Test A-share via different function\ntry:\n    df = ak.stock_zh_a_hist(symbol='000001', period='daily', start_date='20260501', adjust='')\n    print('✅ AKShare A股 平安银行:', len(df), '行')\n    print(df.tail(2).to_string(index=False))\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print('❌ A股:', e)\n\n# Test HK via different function  \ntry:\n    df = ak.stock_hk_hist(symbol='09992', period='daily', start_date='20260501', adjust='')\n    print('✅ AKShare 港股 9992:', len(df), '行')\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print('❌ 港股:', e)\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":662,"output":550,"cacheRead":85312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86524,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779044838504}}
{"type":"message","id":"7083467b","parentId":"a7bc840a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T19:07:30.210Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5a4bf28811ff4eab87252963","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ AKShare美股 AAPL: 9949 行, 最新收盘: 300.23\n❌ A股: ('Connection aborted.', RemoteDisconnected('Remote end closed connection without response'))\n❌ 港股: ('Connection aborted.', RemoteDisconnected('Remote end closed connection without response'))"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1073,"aggregated":"✅ AKShare美股 AAPL: 9949 行, 最新收盘: 300.23\n❌ A股: ('Connection aborted.', RemoteDisconnected('Remote end closed connection without response'))\n❌ 港股: ('Connection aborted.', RemoteDisconnected('Remote end closed connection without response'))","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779044850208}}
{"type":"message","id":"e377d455","parentId":"7083467b","timestamp":"2026-05-17T19:07:41.779Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the situation is clear:\n\n**Working on this VPS:**\n- AKShare US stocks ✅ (stock_us_daily - uses Yahoo Finance internally)\n- Ainvest API ✅ (US stocks only)\n- coze_web_search ✅ (any data via search)\n\n**NOT working:**\n- AKShare A-stock ❌ (eastmoney connection refused)\n- AKShare HK stocks ❌ (same issue)\n- yfinance ❌ (curl_cffi TLS error)\n- ccxt/Binance ❌ (connection reset)\n- AKShare crypto ❌ (outdated data)\n\nThe core issue is this VPS's network connectivity to Chinese financial data sources (eastmoney.com) and crypto exchanges (binance.com) is blocked/reset.\n\nFor the data pipeline, the most reliable approach would be:\n1. US stocks: AKShare (stock_us_daily) or Ainvest\n2. Everything else: coze_web_search (our existing tool)\n\nLet me write a summary for VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 VAN，安装完成，以下是实测结果：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 已安装\n\n| 包 | 版本 | 状态 |\n|---|---|---|\n| AKShare | 1.18.60 | ✅ 已装 |\n| yfinance | 1.3.0 | ✅ 已装 (TLS问题) |\n| ccxt | 已有 | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n## 📊 本VPS网络连通性实测\n\n| 数据源 | 连接 | 说明 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **AKShare 美股** | ✅ 可用 | AAPL 最新收盘 $300.23 |\n| **Ainvest API** | ✅ 可用 | 美股日K正常 |\n| **AKShare A股** | ❌ 东方财富拒绝连接 | VPS网络问题 |\n| **AKShare 港股** | ❌ 同上 | VPS网络问题 |\n| **yfinance** | ❌ TLS错误 | curl_cffi兼容问题 |\n| **ccxt/Binance** | ❌ 连接重置 | 被墙 |\n| **coze_web_search** | ✅ 可用 | 万能兜底 |\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 结论\n\n这台VPS **仅能直连美股数据**（AKShare/Ainvest），A股/港股/加密/外汇的直连API全部不通。\n\n**实际可用方案：**\n\n| 数据 | 方案 |\n|------|------|\n| 🇺🇸 美股 | AKShare (stock_us_daily) + Ainvest |\n| 🇨🇳 A股/港股 | coze_web_search 搜索 |\n| ₿ 加密货币 | coze_web_search 搜索 |\n| 🥇 商品/外汇 | coze_web_search 搜索 |\n\n如果后续需要直连A股/港股数据，可能需要换一台国内VPS或配置代理。当前 `coze_web_search` 作为万能兜底方案其实够用，数据质量也不错。\n\n需要我把这套混合数据方案写成自动化脚本集成到心跳扫描中吗？ 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":522,"output":867,"cacheRead":85952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87341,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779044850212}}
