{"type":"message","id":"9ff58b17","parentId":"3df809ff","timestamp":"2026-05-17T19:29:13.275Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I have a clear picture of what works:\n\n**✅ Working on api0.itick.org (free tier):**\n- `stock/quote?region=US&code=AAPL` ✅ - US stocks\n- `stock/quote?region=US&code=NVDA` ✅ - US stocks\n- `stock/quote?region=US&code=TSLA` ✅ - US stocks\n- `stock/quote?region=HK&code=700` ✅ - HK stocks (without leading zero)\n- `stock/quote?region=HK&code=9992` ✅ - HK stocks (泡泡玛特! without leading zero)\n- `stock/quote?region=HK&code=9988` ✅ - HK stocks (Alibaba)\n- `forex/quote?region=GB&code=EURUSD` ✅ - Forex\n- `forex/quote?region=GB&code=XAUUSD` ✅ - Gold\n- `forex/quote?region=GB&code=GBPUSD` ✅ - Forex\n- `forex/quote?region=GB&code=USDJPY` ✅ - Forex\n- `forex/quote?region=GB&code=USOIL` ✅ - Crude Oil\n\n**❌ Not working:**\n- `stock/quote?region=HK&code=09992` - null (needs 4-digit code, not 5)\n- `stock/quote?region=US&code=SPY` - null (ETF not supported?)\n- `stock/quote?region=HK&code=1810` - null (this one returned empty)\n- `stock/kline` - returns empty (klines not available on free tier?)\n- `forex/kline` - returns empty\n- `crypto/quote` - returns empty/null (crypto not available)\n\nThis is actually a pretty good result! The iTick API provides:\n1. US stocks real-time quotes ✅\n2. HK stocks real-time quotes ✅ (4-digit codes without leading zeros)\n3. Forex real-time quotes ✅\n4. Gold/Oil real-time quotes ✅\n\nThe main limitations are:\n- No crypto support on free tier\n- No historical kline data (only real-time quotes)\n- Some stocks return null (like 1810 Xiaomi)\n\nLet me save this configuration and report to VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 测试完成！iTick API 结果如下：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ iTick API 测试结果\n\n**Base URL:** `https://api0.itick.org`\n**Header:** `token: a652cc8b608e482cadefa30cddeba1d1be5607341262439785a1d549dd0422c5`\n\n### 实时行情接口 `/stock/quote` + `/forex/quote`\n\n| 品种 | Code | 数据 | 价格 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 🇺🇸 AAPL | `AAPL` | ✅ | ~$300 |\n| 🇺🇸 NVDA | `NVDA` | ✅ | $235.74 |\n| 🇺🇸 TSLA | `TSLA` | ✅ | $443.30 |\n| 🇭🇰 腾讯 | `700` | ✅ | HK$454.90 |\n| 🇭🇰 泡泡玛特 | `9992` | ✅ | HK$153.78 |\n| 🇭🇰 阿里巴巴 | `9988` | ✅ | HK$137.90 |\n| 💱 EURUSD | `EURUSD` | ✅ | 1.16698 |\n| 💱 GBPUSD | `GBPUSD` | ✅ | 1.3401 |\n| 💱 USDJPY | `USDJPY` | ✅ | 158.384 |\n| 🥇 黄金 | `XAUUSD` | ✅ | $4,652.27 |\n| 🛢️ 原油 | `USOIL` | ✅ | $102.60 |\n\n### ❌ 不支持\n\n| 品种 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 加密货币 | crypto/quote 返回 null |\n| K线历史数据 | kline 接口返回空 |\n| ETF (SPY) | 返回 null |\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 总结\n\n**iTick 免费版 = 实时行情报价（美股/港股/外汇/商品），无K线历史**\n\n**最终数据方案：**\n\n| 数据 | 主力 | 备用 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 🇺🇸 美股 | iTick 实时报价 | AKShare 历史K线 |\n| 🇭🇰 港股 | iTick 实时报价 | coze_web_search |\n| 💱 外汇/黄金/原油 | iTick 实时报价 | coze_web_search |\n| ₿ 加密货币 | coze_web_search | - |\n| 🇨🇳 A股 | coze_web_search | AKShare (需国内网络) |\n\n这套方案够用吗？还是需要我继续探索 K线数据源？ 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":534,"output":1697,"cacheRead":99456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101687,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779046138987}}
